"cli.binding.group.discussion" = "A binding sends a TARGET when a controller SOURCE is used.\n\nSOURCE: button:NAME, dpad:DIRECTION, axis:NAME[:negative|positive], trigger:NAME:STAGE, motion:lean:DIRECTION, touch:SURFACE:contact, touch:SURFACE:grid:COLUMNS:ROWS:COLUMN:ROW, or touch:SURFACE:swipe:DIRECTION:DISTANCE.\n\nTARGET: key:KEY[:mods=meta,control,alt,shift], mouse:BUTTON, move:x|y, scroll:x|y, gamepad:button:NAME, gamepad:dpad:DIRECTION, gamepad:axis:NAME, or physical:... for rumble, lights, and adaptive triggers.\n\n'ojd profile show' prints bindings in these forms. Edit chords, sequences, and layers with 'ojd profile edit'.";
